<https://blueprinting.dlab5.net/i/cloud-edge/Assessment/assessment-household-is-a-smarthome> a archimate:Assessment;
    archimate:identifier "assessment-household-is-a-smarthome";
    archimate:name "Two products arrived at the same tenant shape";
    archimate:documentation "The Mediathek household and the DigitalHome SmartHome were designed apart and ended up with the same structure: a minted tenant id, admins, readers and per-tenant content.";
